--------------------------------------------------------------------------------
models/metaformer.py
--------------------------------------------------------------------------------
Adapted from PoolFormer / MetaFormer
    https://github.com/sail-sg/poolformer
    Copyright 2021 Garena Online Private Limited
    Licensed under the Apache License, Version 2.0

Yu et al., "MetaFormer is Actually What You Need for Vision", CVPR 2022.

Changes: the block/patch-embedding/position-embedding scaffolding is reused, but
the multi-stage hierarchy with downsampling is replaced by a single stage at fixed
resolution, the MLP module is generalized into a swappable channel mixer, and the
model is parameterized over token mixers.

The DropPath (stochastic depth) implementation follows the standard formulation
also used by timm (Copyright 2019 Ross Wightman, Apache-2.0).

--------------------------------------------------------------------------------
analysis/erf.py
--------------------------------------------------------------------------------
Adapted from RepLKNet-pytorch
    https://github.com/DingXiaoH/RepLKNet-pytorch
    Licensed under the MIT License

Ding et al., "Scaling Up Your Kernels to 31x31: Revisiting Large Kernel Design in
CNNs", CVPR 2022.

Changes: the effective-receptive-field measurement is extended to MetaFormer-style
[B, C, H, W] models and to arbitrary anchor patches, and the Effective Receptive
Distance (ERD) metric proposed in this work is built on top of it.

